<title>USA: Fiserv Inc gets $12 million contract.</title>
<headline>Fiserv Inc gets $12 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiserv Inc, a financial services technology company, said Friday it has received a five-year, $12 million contract to provide resource management for banks affiliated with Marquette Bancshares Inc of Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Marquette and its related banks will receive dedicated Fiserv Comprehensive Banking System software, along with hardware and personnel, Fiserv said.</p>
<p>Fiserv shares fell 1/8 to 38-1/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
